WEBVTT

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:06.920
It possesses enormous power,
and brings endless pleasure

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.880
and destruction  to those who are destined.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.630
The Witchblade.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:15.630
At this moment, one woman has awakened.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:33.460
Just before the shot, my chest feels like it's gonna tear open

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:37.050
I shout out countless times, break out

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:42.240
It's not over, rush through the endless night

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:47.530
Hot blood flows through my body

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:51.240
The moment it ultimately rots away

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:57.840
it's all over, fragments of an empty dream come to mind

00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:03.340
I can never go back, I can't remember a thing

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:08.880
I've been reduced to struggling, and my voice won't carry

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:12.390
Uncontrollable impulses

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:19.310
Give me your XTC, let me feel it one more time

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:26.530
This body heats up, and I shout out your name in the darkness

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:33.530
Give me your XTC, I don't need false love

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:36.710
I will accept it, sin and punishment

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:43.280
Slash through the destiny I've been set up with, Blade

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:53.770
"Bewilderment"

00:01:59.780 --> 00:02:01.200
Mom!

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:08.250
Hey, did a woman come this way?

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:09.370
You mean my mom?

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:13.590
No, a strange woman
wearing armor or something.

00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:16.340
I'm sure she ran this way...

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:17.800
Did you see my mom?

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:22.140
Huh? Oh. Sorry,
but this is as far as I go.

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:24.760
There're police all over, so ask them.

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:26.680
I can't ask the police! Please!

00:02:26.770 --> 00:02:29.310
I just need to get inside, so please help me!

00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:34.060
Forget it! Besides, you escaped
from the Dept. of Child Welfare!

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:39.650
I'll get in trouble if I help you.
It's the law, y'know?

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:42.660
Nope! Can't use the same trick twice!

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:45.530
Fine! I'll look for her myself!

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:52.420
Hey, stop! It's too graphic for kids
to see! You won't be able to sleep!

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.670
My mom!
I said stop!

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:00.760
Tozawa! What're you doing?!

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:01.680
Yikes!

00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:08.350
Why do I always find you sneaking around?!

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:10.600
Good question. I wonder why?

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:15.560
Isn't it too early to be on the scene?
You have some information?

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:20.990
Don't be silly! But is this related
to all the murders? You only

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:22.320
Shut up!

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:29.490
Who's the kid? Don't tell me you...

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:35.080
Oh, I just started babysitting!
Well, thanks for all your hard work!

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:42.220
Any other time, I'd teach him a lesson!

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:50.060
Phew, that was close!
Nakata would kick my ass in a fight...

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:58.110
Hey, if you don't like the cops,
I'd stay away from there for a while.

00:03:58.190 --> 00:03:59.110
Yeah...

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:03.820
You'll find out about your mom in time,
so go back to Child Welfare.

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:06.700
Never!

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:08.450
You got anywhere else to go?

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:12.700
No...

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:35.940
It's me, Segawa.

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:37.600
Enter.

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:43.570
We have her, sir. She's in the guest room.

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:45.280
Did you find out who she is?

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:49.950
According to the police database,
she has a Lost ID.

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:55.040
In other words, all her records
were lost during the Great Earthquake.

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:57.670
The government opened a new ID file on her.

00:04:57.750 --> 00:05:01.250
That's rare. That usually happens
with children and the elderly.

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:05.470
She lost her memory during
the Great Quake six years ago.

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:06.550
I see.

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:09.760
When she was brought to the hospital,
the only thing confirmed

00:05:09.850 --> 00:05:14.430
was that she was the mother
of the infant she was with.

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:17.310
There was nothing in her maternity
record book about her identity?

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:20.770
No. And no family members came to claim her.

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:25.190
But what's most interesting is
where they were both rescued...

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:28.450
...Naru Point, the epicenter of the disaster.

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:33.950
I believe that's where she
encountered the Witchblade.

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:37.250
Although, who knows whether
that was a good thing or bad...

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:51.550
We're here.
Where are we?

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:53.810
My office-cum-sleeping quarters.

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:56.810
It was an explosion,
but do they know the cause?

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:58.770
Nothing definite has been determined.

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:03.230
Inside sources say the suspect
smuggled in explosives...

00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:04.690
That hasn't been

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:06.820
We understand there were
very few guards on duty.

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:09.030
Yo.
Welcome back!

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:14.530
What's with the kid?!

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:16.660
Some stuff came up...

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:18.370
Hello.

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:23.540
So you brought her here?

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:25.340
Yeah.

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:26.760
Are you crazy?!

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:31.640
I couldn't help it! I don't wanna
get caught up in any trouble!

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:33.550
I found a story I wanna follow!

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:34.680
Ridiculous!

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:39.600
You should've stayed out of headlines
and stuck to taking pictures!

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:41.690
Pictures like this one!

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:44.310
This one's gonna be a big scoop!

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:47.360
And when it breaks, I'll pay
you the rent many times over!

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:50.280
I just want one month's rent... Now!

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:52.700
Err... nope. Can't, right now.

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:55.780
Naomi! If you're so concerned, come here!

00:06:55.870 --> 00:07:00.410
Cripes, you're a fortune-teller!
What's the use if you're gonna be shy?!

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:03.210
Maybe you should change careers.

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:06.420
It's not NaOmi... It's Naomi...

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:08.760
Thank you for the meal.

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:13.800
You're spending the night at my place.
You can't stay with him.

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:15.100
Don't even got a bed.

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:17.810
Now listen. You're going back
to the Child Welfare tomorrow!

00:07:17.890 --> 00:07:18.810
Eh?!

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:21.890
No! Please! Don't tell them!

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:27.020
I'm not listening to your pleas!
Well, it's time for bed! Come here!

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:31.990
Please! I'll help with
the cooking and cleaning!

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:37.330
Yeah, right! Child Welfare
would sue me if I did that!

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:40.580
Come on! Quit being dumb!
No!

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:44.830
I said come out!
No!

00:07:44.920 --> 00:07:47.250
No!

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:49.500
Hey! Stay still!

00:07:49.590 --> 00:07:54.340
C'mon! Let go! Settle down!

00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:59.060
Then stay there! I'm going to call
Child Welfare tomorrow anyway!

00:08:00.020 --> 00:08:03.020
Cripes! That's one little bag
of trouble you brought back!

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:06.560
She's pretty gutsy, to defy you.

00:08:07.610 --> 00:08:13.740
Well, guess I'll get some sleep
and develop my big story tomorrow.

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:16.160
Your luck will run low in the afternoon.

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:19.280
I've always liked to have fun.

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:20.620
Well, good night.

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:23.660
You too, kiddo.

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:39.890
Good grief... Such a stubborn child.

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:49.860
Mom...

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:58.490
I'm freezing now.

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:31.770
Eh?! What's going on?!

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:36.240
You're awake?

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:39.780
I brought you some breakfast.

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:46.500
Umm... Where am I?

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:49.620
You're in the VIP room
of Douji Group Industries.

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:51.040
Douji?

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:53.590
We rank in the top ten internationally.

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:56.630
Umm... Why am I here?

00:09:56.720 --> 00:10:00.590
Director Takayama will
explain it to you after breakfast.

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:05.640
Forgive my rudeness. I am Segawa,
Director Takayama's assistant.

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:07.230
Please enjoy your breakfast.

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:09.230
Umm !

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:12.060
It seems the tranquilizer
hasn't quite worn off.

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:14.860
I suggest you take it easy for a while.

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:20.320
If you need anything, just call
me at extension 33. Excuse me.

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:38.970
Riko!

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:46.310
Riko...

00:10:46.390 --> 00:10:48.890
Yes, I have her.

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:55.610
Who cares how she got here?
Just come get her.

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:59.690
Yes, thank you for contacting us!

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:01.700
Rihoko-Chan's been found?!

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:05.160
Yes! Whew, what a relief!

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:06.830
Sakurai-san!

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:09.080
Father is back.

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:10.750
Oh no!

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:16.710
It is one year since the chairman
of the non-profit organization NSWF,

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:19.590
Furumizu Tatsuoki, appeared in public.

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:22.510
He's come to check on the progress
of the Dept. of Child Welfare,

00:11:22.590 --> 00:11:25.140
which he helped the government establish.

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:29.680
NSWF has focused its work
in areas that benefit children,

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:32.980
and Mr. Furumizu is
lovingly nicknamed, "Father."

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:34.600
Bye-bye!

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:39.650
Any word on the Witchblade?

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:41.650
Not yet.

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:43.910
Let us hurry.

00:11:43.990 --> 00:11:45.870
Bye-bye!

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:52.750
Two of the victims in the
Pulverizer Murders worked at the NSWF.

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:56.580
Just past the NSWF facility
where I found the kid was a monster.

00:11:56.670 --> 00:12:01.260
And even Detective Nakata of
Special Investigations showed up...

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:07.390
Are they all connected? Nah, couldn't be...

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:21.480
Where are we going? You said you'd explain...

00:12:21.570 --> 00:12:25.700
We will, but we need to
go somewhere else for that.

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:27.450
The director will join us.

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:36.040
This way, please.

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:40.040
Don't you think it's wise to listen
first and try to grasp the situation?

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:58.900
You're the director?

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:00.400
Yes.

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:14.160
I understood that I'd get
an explanation of all this.

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:17.120
We have searched hard and long.
Huh?

00:13:17.210 --> 00:13:18.500
For that.

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:24.130
Do you remember what happened last night?

00:13:29.220 --> 00:13:30.720
Somewhat...

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:33.010
Has that ever happened before?

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:37.020
That was the first time! What was that?!

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:40.810
What is this thing?! If you know, tell me!

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:42.650
The Witchblade.

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:46.070
The Witchblade?

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:49.610
The most powerful weapon of all.
It's existed since ancient times.

00:13:49.700 --> 00:13:54.240
The one who possesses this
has the power to control the world.

00:13:54.330 --> 00:14:00.290
To that end, battles over it have
been secretly fought for millennia.

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:02.090
I've never heard about

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:06.800
What benefit is it to boast
about the existence of treasure?

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:11.300
I can tell you more about its past,
but it has nothing to do with you.

00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:14.930
In any case, its final
owners were the Douji Group.

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:20.600
However, it was lost in the
Great Earthquake six years ago...

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:24.610
...at the epicenter of the disaster, Naru Point.

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:25.610
That's !

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:30.240
Yes, where you were found, it seems.

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:32.660
You know a lot about me.

00:14:32.740 --> 00:14:37.450
I had you checked out. Including
about your assault of a police officer.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:39.910
That was...

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:44.920
Whatever, but that's a rude tone
to use with someone you just met!

00:14:49.090 --> 00:14:54.510
There's no mistake you encountered
the Witchblade during the Quake.

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:56.640
But why me?

00:14:56.720 --> 00:14:59.270
You should ask the Witchblade that.

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:00.690
Ask?

00:15:00.770 --> 00:15:06.150
From what we know, not just
anyone can don the Witchblade.

00:15:06.230 --> 00:15:09.030
And throughout history,
only women have been able to do that.

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:09.900
Women?

00:15:09.990 --> 00:15:12.610
But simply being a woman isn't enough.

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:15.660
Most women are incompatible with it.

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:18.700
We don't know what conditions must be met.

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:22.830
In any case, you were
chosen by the Witchblade.

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:27.500
Hold on a sec! I don't
know what's what anymore...

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:29.090
I expect not.

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:53.950
Enough! Let's cut to the chase!

00:15:54.030 --> 00:15:58.490
Basically, this belongs to you, right?
Take it off! You can have it back!

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:02.160
I'm afraid we can't.
Why not?!

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:05.170
We're still researching how to remove it.

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:10.250
But if you insist, we can cut off your arm.

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:13.760
Get serious! Do something about this thing!

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:17.640
There's no need to be troubled.
It's a power worth having.

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:23.180
I don't need its "power"!
Not for you. For us.

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:25.690
I told you, it belongs to us.

00:16:25.770 --> 00:16:28.690
Since it cannot be removed,
you belong to us, too.

00:16:28.770 --> 00:16:32.400
W-What the hell are you talking about?!

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:35.410
From now on, you will work for us.

00:16:35.490 --> 00:16:38.780
Thanks, but I prefer to find my own employment.

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:41.790
Let me off! I've had enough explanations!

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:44.660
I know this has nothing to do with me now!

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:48.170
Oww! Let go!

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:52.260
You cannot escape. As long
as you wear the Witchblade,

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:55.840
you will battle, regardless of what you want.

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:58.590
Battle? Battle who?

00:16:58.680 --> 00:16:59.930
You'll find out soon.

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:03.930
Forget it! Let me go home!

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:06.480
Home to where?

00:17:06.560 --> 00:17:10.650
You escaped from the detention
center amid all the confusion.

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:13.280
You brought me here!

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:16.450
You're guilty of breaking child
welfare laws, obstructing justice,

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:19.570
destruction of property,
and running from the law.

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:22.620
Your daughter would cry if she heard.

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:24.250
Don't tell me you have Rihoko, too!

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:26.540
She ran away from the Child Welfare Center.

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:27.830
Huh?!

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:30.170
Naturally, we're looking for her.

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:33.420
Idiot! Why didn't you tell me that first?!

00:17:34.670 --> 00:17:37.510
How long are you going to glare at it?!

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:40.680
Eat it! Or I can't clean up!

00:17:43.810 --> 00:17:45.930
Umm...
There's time!

00:17:46.020 --> 00:17:49.900
...update on last night's explosion
at the South Asagaya Det. Center.

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:53.360
It has been learned that a woman
being held at the detention center

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:55.860
is currently missing.

00:17:55.940 --> 00:17:59.860
There is also a possibility that
she was buried in the rubble,

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:01.950
and a search is currently underway.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:05.040
Was that about Mom?

00:18:05.120 --> 00:18:07.620
Who knows? They only said "woman."

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:13.710
She escaped in the confusion, right?
That's what I'd do.

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:17.920
You're right. Mom can run fast...

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:19.840
Is that so?

00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:27.640
Mom ran away... I just know it!

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:35.110
Let me off! Let me off!

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:37.740
We've arrived.
Eh?!

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:39.990
Our company's prized lab.

00:18:40.070 --> 00:18:41.360
Lab?

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:47.870
Kid!

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:52.250
Mariko-san! At least knock, will ya?

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:54.670
That girl is gone!
Eh?

00:18:56.300 --> 00:18:58.260
"Thanks for letting me
stay the night. Rihoko"

00:19:06.140 --> 00:19:11.230
First, I wish to see with my own
eyes what this Witchblade is like.

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:24.660
What's happening?!
Hey! Hey! What's going on?!

00:19:24.740 --> 00:19:27.870
Let me out! Hey! Open up!

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:33.620
I've had enough of this!
Open up! What's going on?!

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:57.150
What is this?!

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:18.090
Hey!

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:23.380
What are you planning to do?!

00:20:23.470 --> 00:20:27.050
What will it be? Are you sure
we can begin so suddenly?

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:29.180
I don't care. Begin.

00:20:45.610 --> 00:20:49.740
Riko... I'm sure she's looking for me...

00:20:55.870 --> 00:20:58.750
This is her completed form...

00:21:07.840 --> 00:21:11.180
I feel it... I feel it!

00:21:25.530 --> 00:21:28.950
If you get lost, let's meet
under the Tokyo Tower!

00:21:57.190 --> 00:22:07.280
I murmur, "I love you," with all my emotion

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:16.620
All my feelings until yesterday now overflow and dissolve quickly

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:28.550
If only this one last prayer could make it through...

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:37.390
Thank you for giving us the words to ascertain each other, God

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:49.400
Tomorrow, we'll reach out and hold hands harder than normal

00:22:49.490 --> 00:23:02.420
Tomorrow, we'll reach out, hug, kiss, and love each other

00:23:12.800 --> 00:23:15.510
You're definitely okay, right?!

00:23:15.600 --> 00:23:18.350
We'll definitely meet again, right?!

00:23:18.430 --> 00:23:20.430
I was almost taken back

00:23:20.520 --> 00:23:22.230
to that horrible Child Welfare Center,

00:23:22.310 --> 00:23:24.730
but I escaped, so don't worry!

00:23:24.820 --> 00:23:26.610
Hang in there, Mom!

00:23:26.690 --> 00:23:29.820
Eat properly and cheer up!

00:23:29.900 --> 00:23:33.490
I'll be waiting at the promised spot.

00:23:33.570 --> 00:23:35.700
I'll wait forever!
